sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Overlay as 悬浮窗服务
    participant Watcher as 防逃逸引擎
    participant Foreground as 前台服务
    
    User->>Overlay: 启动专注
    activate Overlay
    Overlay->>Overlay: 创建WindowManager
    Overlay->>Overlay: 添加全屏覆盖视图<br/>(TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY)
    Overlay->>Foreground: 启动前台服务
    activate Foreground
    Foreground->>Foreground: 显示持续性通知
    Foreground->>Foreground: 提升进程oom_adj
    
    Overlay->>Watcher: 启动防逃逸监控
    activate Watcher
    
    loop 每300ms轮询
        Watcher->>Watcher: 查询UsageStatsManager
        Watcher->>Watcher: 检测前台应用包名
    end
    
    User->>User: 尝试切换应用
    Watcher->>Watcher: 检测到逃逸行为
    Watcher->>Overlay: 触发拉回Intent<br/>(50-100ms延迟)
    Overlay->>User: 应用回到前台
    
    User->>Overlay: 完成专注
    Overlay->>Watcher: 停止轮询
    deactivate Watcher
    Overlay->>Overlay: 移除悬浮窗视图
    Overlay->>Foreground: 停止前台服务
    deactivate Foreground
    Overlay->>User: 显示专注结果
    deactivate Overlay
